              'Fragment size distribution is not captured — the model tracks total count, not the size spectrum that determines collision risk',
              'The quadratic collision term assumes uncorrelated velocities — objects in similar orbits have low relative velocities',
              'Mega-constellations introduce non-uniform, time-varying source terms not captured by a constant launch rate',
              'Active debris removal concepts are not modeled — sink terms include only natural decay',
